Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:04.40,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Pa Pa Panty STOCKING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:07.32,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.78,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty & Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.24,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Pa Pa Panty STOCKING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:13.45,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.23,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,We're the baddest, no fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.54,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,let the ghosts appear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.83,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Lock and load, baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,we takin' the lead here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty n Stocking, Panty n Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,(We) Wreck this system,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,our power is extreme
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.09,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.27,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty & Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:29.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,New!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.23,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,飛揚跋扈 無所畏懼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.54,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,惡靈儘管肆虐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.83,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,上膛完畢 寶貝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.58,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,我們將主宰全場
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.13,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,掀翻規則
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.38,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,我們力量爆表
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:39.67,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I woke up again with the same regret
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:44.22,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Jump into this mess no exit yet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:47.34,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Every choice I make it falls apart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:51.02,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the beat the groove is in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:54.69,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Pathetic I wear it like a crown
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.69,0:22:57.31,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I crash I burn I laugh out loud
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.86,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:01.90,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.61,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:09.74,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.75,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.71,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,They think they know me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:17.58,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the old me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:19.63,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Used to control me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:22.21,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But now they moldy… yup
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:23.63,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Committed and I did it and you label me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:25.72,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,a menace and a villain cause you can’t get with it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:27.64,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,hate my presence hate my business
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:29.51,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,got no feelings… good riddance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:33.18,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:37.85,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:40.98,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:45.65,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.33,0:22:39.67,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我帶著相同悔恨醒來
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.67,0:22:44.22,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,縱身躍進這仍無出口的混亂中
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.22,0:22:47.34,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,每個選擇都讓一切崩壞
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.34,0:22:51.02,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但這節拍紮根 律動在我血脈
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.02,0:22:54.69,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,可悲啊 我仍引以為傲
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.69,0:22:57.31,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我崩潰我燃燒我大笑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.86,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,耶！耶！耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.86,0:23:01.90,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知魯莽
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.61,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有瘋狂 讓我活下來
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.61,0:23:09.74,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲絕望頌 只為我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.75,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.71,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,他們自以為懂我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.71,0:23:17.58,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但那已是過去的我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.58,0:23:19.63,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,習慣控制我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.63,0:23:22.21,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,早成過期貨…呵
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.21,0:23:23.63,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我做到了 你還在貼標籤
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.63,0:23:25.72,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,視我為威脅 說我是惡棍 因為你接不住招
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.72,0:23:27.64,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,憎恨我的存在 詆譭我的行為
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.64,0:23:29.51,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,無所謂…好走不送
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.51,0:23:33.18,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知魯莽
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.18,0:23:37.85,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有瘋狂 讓我活下來
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.85,0:23:40.98,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲絕望頌 只為我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.98,0:23:45.65,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
